    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract worker node that can execute an ingestion sub-run. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Each node is responsible for ingesting a subset of sources assigned by the <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_ingestion_coordinator" kindref="compound">IngestionCoordinator</ref></computeroutput> via consistent hashing. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
